de detectives llegue a ellos.

467
00:41:39,080 --> 00:41:41,165
&lt;i>Bueno, basta de este desastre.&lt;/i>

468
00:41:41,332 --> 00:41:43,793
&lt;i>¿Algo interesante
de los recién liberados?&lt;/i>

469
00:41:44,419 --> 00:41:45,378
Mucho.

470
00:41:46,170 --> 00:41:47,630
Te cuento cuando aterricemos.

471
00:41:47,839 --> 00:41:49,090
&lt;i>Ven directo conmigo.&lt;/i>

472
00:41:49,382 --> 00:41:51,926
